  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup butter or margarine",
    "1 pound light brown sugar",
    "1 (14 ounce) can sweetened condensed milk",
    "1 cup light corn syrup",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1.5 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/avOE9SU-rbaWm0NAcdWkOHntjy4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/95294-chewy-caramel-ddmfs-step-1-0774-286c80041319438d8436e07630779c8b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/95294/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine butter, brown sugar, condensed milk, corn syrup, and salt in a heavy-bottomed saucepan over medium heat. Bring to a boil, stirring constantly. Heat to between 234 and 240 degrees F (112 to 116 degrees C), or until a small amount of the mixture dropped into cold water forms a soft ball that flattens when removed from the water and placed on a flat surface. Cook for 2 minutes at that temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/89HUn6EiaDo5YxUpXuwvh4oEA4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/95294-chewy-caramel-ddmfs-step-3-0776-7788970165d941b895e90104e1bffd4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/95294/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat and stir in vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bnGuncCAML-G9HOPKPf2iL1VMgg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/95294-chewy-caramel-ddmfs-step-4-0777-eb500003fda74d07a6f843b1b1a9a5e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/95294/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, butter a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When the caramel is ready, pour it into the buttered pan. Allow it to cool completely at room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w4RmVV5mqOznC4R4QEilx3DLS3E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/95294-chewy-caramel-ddmfs-step-5-0803-d177bb61d516434f9b58310e0ed0f5e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/95294/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the pan and cut into squares using scissors. Wrap individual pieces in waxed paper or cellophane.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
